Query:
--Description: Inspect every driver’s position changes in the first-five laps
--             of one sample race (here race_id = 1) – this lets us see
--             which cars gained or lost places lap-by-lap.
SELECT  "race_id",
        "driver_id",
        "lap",
        "position",
        "lap_type"
FROM    "lap_positions"
WHERE   "race_id" = 1
  AND   "lap"    <= 5
ORDER BY "lap", "position"
LIMIT 20;
Answer:
race_id,driver_id,lap,position,lap_type
